sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant GW as Gateway
    participant Inf as Inference
    participant Tr as Tracing
    participant SLO as SLO evaluator
    U->>GW: request, trace id attached
    GW->>Inf: propagate the trace
    Inf-->>U: first token
    Note over U,Inf: TTFT — the number the user actually feels
    loop remaining tokens
        Inf-->>U: token
        Note over Inf: inter-token latency — smoothness, measured separately
    end
    GW->>Tr: spans for every hop
    Tr->>SLO: percentiles per stage
    SLO->>SLO: which stage spent the budget?
    Note over SLO: one request SLO hides the answer — split the token path into stages
